      "role": "user",
      "content": "I guess I get that now. It's just frustrating because it looks so much like something has actually grown on the chocolate. It's almost like it's an unwanted guest that just shows up when you aren't looking. Is there any way to tell if a batch is going to bloom before it's too late, or is it always a surprise?",
